# Local additions - OpenAI
# ChatGPT Web/Desktop, OpenAI API, Codex, SSO, static assets, files and diagnostics
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# openai.com covers auth.openai.com and its subdomains. stripe.com covers js.stripe.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripe.com
DOMAIN,cdn.openaimerge.com

# WorkOS sign-in, SSO setup and assets, Cloudflare challenge, and SendGrid email links
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# Exclude upstream: DOMAIN-SUFFIX,workos.com
# Exclude upstream: DOMAIN-KEYWORD,workos
DOMAIN,cdn.workos.com
DOMAIN,forwarder.workos.com
DOMAIN,frontend-apps-multi-region.workos.com
DOMAIN,images.workoscdn.com
DOMAIN,setup.workos.com
DOMAIN,workos.imgix.net
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ct.sendgrid.net

# Apple hosts listed for ChatGPT connectivity and iOS App Attest diagnostics
DOMAIN,humb.apple.com
DOMAIN,register.appattest.apple.com

# OpenAI Sentry projects and Datadog RUM intake
# Exclude upstream: DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
# Exclude upstream: DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadoghq.com
# Exclude upstream: DOMAIN-KEYWORD,datadog
DOMAIN,o207216.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com

# Codex CLI install/update via npm, GitHub Releases fallback or Homebrew
# chatgpt.com and openai.com cover the primary installer and binary host.
# https://github.com/openai/codex#installing-and-running-codex-cli
# https://formulae.brew.sh/cask/codex
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,api.github.com
DOMAIN,release-assets.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,formulae.brew.sh

# Sora data export (sora.chatgpt.com), with sora.com retained from VPSDance
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001152-what-to-know-about-the-sora-discontinuation

# Network - firewall and proxy requirements
# ChatGPT wss://ws.chatgpt.com and Codex wss://chatgpt.com/ need WebSocket upgrade over TCP 443.
# ChatGPT Voice prefers UDP 3478 to https://openai.com/chatgpt-voice.json destinations, with TCP 443 fallback.
# The domain rules cover named endpoints. Allow the current Voice IPs and ports in the firewall separately.
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# Connectors, Codex cloud and PSP egress ranges apply at receiving services.
# https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/ip-addresses
